{"seq":2,"slug":"data","title":"数据流","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spectator-observer-systems/data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-broadcasting","title":"状态广播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spectator-observer-systems/data/state-broadcasting","wordCount":1755,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"spectator-delay","title":"观战延迟与防作弊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spectator-observer-systems/data/spectator-delay","wordCount":1720,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"bandwidth-scaling","title":"带宽与海量观众","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spectator-observer-systems/data/bandwidth-scaling","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据流\">数据流</h1><p>观战系统真正难的部分，几乎都集中在数据如何从权威服务器流到观众眼前这条路径上。基础章定下了「观战是独立子系统」「中继树是主流架构」，本章把这条路径上的三个核心矛盾逐一拆开。</p>\n<p>第一个矛盾是「广播什么」。观众不参与模拟，却需要看到全场——这意味着要把权威状态打包成所有观众都能消费的广播流，既不能像玩家那样只发可见区域（观众要上帝视角），又不能把完整 tick 数据原样塞给百万观众。第一篇讲状态广播的打包、增量与关键帧策略。</p>\n<p>第二个矛盾是「何时给观众看」。观众流必须故意滞后于真实对局——否则任何能拿到实时观战流的人（队友、教练、外接屏）就获得了「幽灵视角」，直接等于作弊。第二篇讲观战延迟的设计：滞后多少、滞后在哪一层、以及它如何与防作弊耦合。</p>\n<p>第三个矛盾是「人多了怎么办」。观众数从几十涨到几百万时，带宽用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PxS</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PxS} = P \\times S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PxS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（玩家数乘观众数）的量级爆炸，单台服务器无论如何扛不住。第三篇讲带宽与海量观众：中继树的扇出、视频转码的降级、以及在什么规模上必须从「状态广播」切换到「视频广播」。</p>\n<p>这三篇是强耦合的：延迟的设计影响你能不能用中继树缓冲，带宽的瓶颈又反过来逼你把延迟做大。读完本章，你会理解为什么职业赛事的公开观战流通常滞后 5–10 分钟、为什么它们最终都长得像一棵中继树或一条视频 CDN。</p>\n"}